msgid ""
"Refill Retry reevaluates the buffer; it does not retry failed chapters or "
"override pending deletion. Stop download ahead turns the policy Off but "
"keeps accepted jobs. Cancel retires the current refill for that manga; "
"Cancel all retires every refill. Cancellation keeps ahead enabled for later "
"reading or chapter actions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Refill follows completed close, including native next-file reading; manual "
"read/unread; actual read reconciliation; successful chapter load/return/"
"refresh; and ahead or scanlator changes. Repaint, progress, and cancellation "
"do not create refill requests. Pending work survives offline operation and "
"restart."
msgstr ""

